    "Text": "Unsign <If(PlayerParameter(8))><sheet(ObjStr,PlayerParameter(8),0)><Else/>ObjectParameter(3)</If>'s free company petition?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 256854,
    "RowId": 2869,
    "Text": "Delete <If(PlayerParameter(8))><sheet(ObjStr,PlayerParameter(8),0)><Else/>ObjectParameter(3)</If>'s signature from the free company petition?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 256942,
    "RowId": 2870,
    "Text": "Request <If(PlayerParameter(8))><sheet(ObjStr,PlayerParameter(8),0)><Else/>ObjectParameter(3)</If> sign your petition to form a free company?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 257030,
    "RowId": 2871,
    "Text": "Pay the 15,000-gil fee and finalize free company formation?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 257102,
    "RowId": 2872,
    "Text": "Invite <If(PlayerParameter(8))><sheet(ObjStr,PlayerParameter(8),0)><Else/>ObjectParameter(3)</If> to your free company?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 257170,
    "RowId": 2873,
    "Text": "Accept <If(PlayerParameter(8))><sheet(ObjStr,PlayerParameter(8),0)><Else/>ObjectParameter(3)</If>'s free company invite?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 257238,
    "RowId": 2874,
    "Text": "Decline <If(PlayerParameter(8))><sheet(ObjStr,PlayerParameter(8),0)><Else/>ObjectParameter(3)</If>'s free company invite?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 257306,
    "RowId": 2875,
    "Text": "You have been released from the free company."
