  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 258694,
    "RowId": 2910,
    "Text": "Three signatures are required to form a free company. Signature requests can be sent in the same manner as party invites. Those who sign your petition will be your free company's first members. Remember, only someone who is not currently a member of another free company can sign your petition."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 259002,
    "RowId": 2911,
    "Text": "Now that you have three signatures, you must speak with an Order of Independent Companies (OIC) administrator to submit your petition and pay the 15,000-gil fee."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 259174,
    "RowId": 2912,
    "Text": "By signing a free company petition, you will become one of its establishing members."
